      "writtenOn": "2025-03-13T14:23:04Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is for cases 32,33, and 60 which don\u0027t need kSrc. Using ```image_premul_src_srcover``` would result in even more combinations.\n\nI think, as a follow up, I will just add a ```image_premul_src``` and remove the combined call. That would split cases 11, 16, 17, 19 and 38 into two sets.",
      "parentUuid": "00e9a85c_1d2a587a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 48,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 48,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "06838ed7b10dc93b712a22d07e90b7f174dab2c8",
